{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111526001:0":{"text":"다들 왜 이렇게 다친거야...","source_cn":"怎么大家都受伤了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB14786742A86BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111526002:0":{"text":"그래도 상처가 깊지 않아서 다행이야. 조금만 휴식을 취하면 금세 다시 팔팔해질 거야.","source_cn":"幸好伤得不重，回来疗养一阵，很快又能活蹦乱跳啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99441700E28DCAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111526003:0":{"text":"우리한테 무슨 일이 있었는지는 안 물어봐?","source_cn":"你不问问，我们遇见了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84F9D122CB05976E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111526004:0":{"text":"에이, 뭘 그런 걸 물어봐? 그 어떤 위험한 일도 소렌 네가 함께했으니까 괜찮았겠지!","source_cn":"哎呀，有什么好问的？无论遇到了什么危险，有你索恩在，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBD5CCDDC63C70D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111526005:0":{"text":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)까지 같이 있어서 전혀 걱정 안 했어!","source_cn":"何况还有<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x833FDA43DA6BD1F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)까지 같이 있어서 전혀 걱정 안 했어!","female":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)까지 같이 있어서 전혀 걱정 안 했어!","variant_male_record_index":"125019","variant_female_record_index":"125020","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111526006:0":{"text":"크흠... 사실 걱정을 전혀 안 한 건 아니고, 조금밖에 안 했어!","source_cn":"咳咳……其实，也不能说一点都不担心，还是有那么一点的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1F85854878B30E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111526007:0":{"text":"진짜 아주 조금밖에 안 했어! 난 너희를 믿으니까!","source_cn":"真的只有一点点哦！因为我相信你们嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11E40B809B119EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111526008:0":{"text":"어쨌든! 소렌, 돌아와서 기뻐.","source_cn":"总之！你终于回来啦，索恩。我很高兴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54DA22FB24CBFCCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111526009:0":{"text":"응, 잘 다녀왔어.","source_cn":"嗯，我回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC446BBA55486DD04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111526010:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 급하게 떠나야 하는 게 아니라면, 우르 부족에 조금 더 머무르는 건 어때?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA5F30076141306","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 급하게 떠나야 하는 게 아니라면, 우르 부족에 조금 더 머무르는 건 어때?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 급하게 떠나야 하는 게 아니라면, 우르 부족에 조금 더 머무르는 건 어때?","variant_male_record_index":"125025","variant_female_record_index":"125026","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111526011:0":{"text":"내가 아주 제대로 대접해주려고! 물론 치피와 해미도!","source_cn":"我会好好招待你的！当然啦，还有满满和漫漫！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50DBECA61CE3428F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 아주 제대로 대접해주려고! 물론 치피와 해미도!","female":"내가 아주 제대로 대접해주려고! 물론 치피와 해미도!","variant_male_record_index":"125027","variant_female_record_index":"125028","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111526012:0":{"text":"맛있는 음식도 엄청 많이 준비했는데, 기대되지 않아?","source_cn":"我准备了不少你们喜欢吃的东西！期待吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8509F5CE0FDFD7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맛있는 음식도 엄청 많이 준비했는데, 기대되지 않아?","female":"맛있는 음식도 엄청 많이 준비했는데, 기대되지 않아?","variant_male_record_index":"125029","variant_female_record_index":"125030","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111526013:0":{"text":"우와아압! 완전 기대돼요!","source_cn":"期待！特别期待！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D559B261D8EB662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111526014:0":{"text":"어휴... 치피, 아르사한테 고맙다는 말하는 거 잊지 마.","source_cn":"唉……满满，要记得谢谢阿尔萨哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC946F0FC6C767A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","varia